## 📋 Phase 90: 美容影院游乐系统 (Beauty Cinema Amusement)

### 新增模块

1. **beauty_salon** (~15K) - 美容沙龙管理系统
   - 服务管理： haircut, facial, manicure, pedicure, massage, coloring
   - 员工管理：stylists (skill levels 1-3), commission rates, schedules
   - 客户管理：membership tiers (bronze/silver/gold/platinum), loyalty points
   - 预约管理：appointments with time slots, duration, service combos
   - 产品管理：shampoo, conditioner, color, styling products, inventory
   - 收入分析：service revenue, product sales, tips, commission payouts

2. **cinema_theater** (~15K) - 影院管理系统
   - 影厅管理：screens (type: standard/IMAX/3D/VIP), seating capacity
   - 排片管理：movies, showtimes, genres, duration, rating
   - 票务管理：tickets (adult/child/senior), matinee pricing, group discounts
   - 卖品管理：concessions (popcorn/drinks/candy), combo deals
   - 会员管理：members, points, rewards, birthday specials
   - 收入分析：ticket revenue, concession revenue, occupancy rates

3. **amusement_park** (~15K) - 游乐园管理系统
   - 设施管理：rides (thrill/family/kids/water), capacity, maintenance status
   - 票务管理：single-day/multi-day/season passes, group rates, fast-pass
   - 游客管理：visitors, age groups, spending patterns, satisfaction
   - 餐饮管理：food stands, restaurants, snack carts, meal deals
   - 员工管理：ride operators, security, maintenance crew, entertainers
   - 收入分析：gate revenue, ride revenue, food revenue, merchandise

